{
  "job_B9.2.6_20251003_115001": {
    "chunk_text": "w\u00e6s XXIII. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s VII hunde wintra & X, feng Octauianus to Romana & he si\u00fe\u00fean V gefeoht ungeferlice \u00feurhteah swa Iulius dyde \u00e6r: an wi\u00fe Pompeius; an w\u00e6s wi\u00f0 Si\u00fe\u00fean him geteah Antonius to gewealdon ealle Asiam. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m he forlet Octauianuses swostor, & him selfum onbead gewin & openne feondscipe. & he him het to wife gefeccan Cleopatron \u00fea cwene, \u00fea h\u00e6fde Iulius \u00e6r, & hiere for \u00fe\u00e6m h\u00e6fde Ra\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s Octauianus gel\u00e6dde fird wi\u00fe Antonius, & hiene ra\u00f0e gefliemde \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee hie tog\u00e6dere \u00de\u00e6s ymb III niht hie gefuhton ut on s\u00e6. Octauianus h\u00e6fde XXX scipa & CC \u00feara miclena \u00feriere\u00f0rena, on \u00fe\u00e6m w\u00e6ron farende eahta & Antonius h\u00e6fde eahtatig scipa, on \u00fe\u00e6m w\u00e6ron farende X legian, for \u00feon swa micle swa he \u00de\u00e6t gefeoht wear\u00f0 swi\u00fee m\u00e6re, \u00feeh \u00fee Octauianus sige h\u00e6fde. \u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6s Antoniuses folces ofslagen XII M; & Cleopatra his cwen wear\u00f0 gefliemed, swa hie \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Octauianus gefeaht wi\u00f0 Antonius, & wi\u00f0 Cleopatron, & hie gefliemde. \u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s on \u00fe\u00e6re tide calendas Agustus, & on \u00fe\u00e6m d\u00e6ge \u00fee we hata\u00f0 hlafm\u00e6sse. Si\u00fe\u00fean w\u00e6s Octauianus Agustus haten, for \u00feon \u00fee he on \u00fe\u00e6re tide sige h\u00e6f",
